  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet adresserar brister och behov f&#xf6;r ett v&#xe4;l fungerande        r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sende i Turkiet och att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra tillg&#xe5;ngen till r&#xe4;ttvisa     genom f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av medling i straffr&#xe4;ttsliga system och till&#xe4;mpning av alternativa tvistl&#xf6;sningsmekanismer i tvistem&#xe5;l.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program at hand addresses gaps and needs in efficient functioning of the judiciary in Turkey for improved access to justice through     improvement of the practice of mediation in criminal justice system   of Turkey and application of alternative dispute resolution           mechanisms in civil disputes.</narrative>
